  data: {
    LLM: 'Turn: Draw one card from Stock or Discard pile, then discard one card. Try to improve suit sum. Knocking: If a player thinks they have high enough score, they knock. Everyone else gets one last turn. Scoring: A=11, K/Q/J=10, Num=Face. 3 of a kind (30pts) is a special rule in some variants.',
    Player: 'Turn: Draw one card from Stock or Discard pile, then discard one card. Try to improve suit sum. Knocking: If a player thinks they have high enough score, they knock. Everyone else gets one last turn. Scoring: A=11, K/Q/J=10, Num=Face. 3 of a kind (30pts) is a special rule in some variants.',
    objective: 'Get a hand totaling 31 points in one suit, or have a higher score than the lowest player.',
